{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Grammar.</b> וישתחו. In Sefer HaYesod. Those who say the bowing was to the Name have said nothing, for Scripture states that he bowed to the children of Heth. And bowing is bending the head, and this is the manner of one who gives praise to another. Also Moses bowed to his father-in-law."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:28.522363085Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}